{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:14597e432df54ad5","name":"Basic Processor","source":{"id":"source:reference-14597e432df54ad5","title":"Basic Processor","revision":16149,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:56:23Z","sha256":"54132e70c17e3b9e7f729e8ae66e7acd9c2efad2c4308cab1049a589590f8793","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16149","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Basic%20Processor&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-14597e432df54ad5","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 0\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Basic Processors are not designed for creative thought and problem solving, and as such most ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," interpret instructions and behavioral inhibitors very literally. Furthermore, Basic Processors are very limited in that the Droid cannot perform any task for which it was not programmed. For example, a Droid that is not ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," skill cannot lie or otherwise convey false or unknown information.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Droid with Basic Processor cannot use any skill ",{"tag":"a","children":["Untrained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Untrained"}," except for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Acrobatics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Acrobatics","referenceId":"reference:0d0b7eee2953750e"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Climb"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Climb","referenceId":"reference:98ca5f27d9642dc7"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jump"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jump","referenceId":"reference:9ee0ca3e24d60ea0"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"},". Similarly, a Basic Processor does not allow a Droid to use any weapon with which it is not proficient, and a Droid's behavioral inhibitors may prevent it from harming sentient living beings altogether. Every ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," comes with a Basic Processor, at the very least.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
